    "chunk_text": ", w\u00e6stmum geniwad, ealles edgiong, \u00fe\u00e6r \u00e6nig ne m\u00e6g in \u00feam Swa nu \u00e6fter dea\u00f0e \u00feurh dryhtnes miht somod si\u00feia\u00fe sawla mid lice, f\u00e6gre gefr\u00e6twed, fugle gelicast, \u00d0onne so\u00f0f\u00e6stum sawlum scine\u00f0 heah ofer hrofas h\u00e6lende Crist. Him folgia\u00f0 fuglas scyne, beorhte gebredade, blissum hremige, in \u00feam gladan ham, g\u00e6stas gecorene, \u00de\u00e6r him yfle ne m\u00e6g fah feond gemah facne sce\u00fe\u00fean, ac \u00fe\u00e6r lifga\u00f0 a leohte werede, swa se fugel Weorc anra gehw\u00e6s beorhte blice\u00f0 in \u00feam bli\u00fean ham fore onsyne ecan dryhtnes, symle in sibbe, \u00de\u00e6r se beorhta beag, brogden wundrum eorcnanstanum, eadigra gehwam hlifa\u00f0 ofer heafde. Heafelan lixa\u00f0, \u00ferymme bi\u00feeahte. \u00d0eodnes cynegold so\u00f0f\u00e6stra gehwone sellic glenge\u00f0 leohte in life, \u00fe\u00e6r se longa gefea, ece ond Ne bi\u00f0 him on \u00feam wicum wiht to sorge, wroht ne we\u00feel ne gewindagas, hungor se hata ne se hearda Him se \u00e6\u00feela cyning forgife\u00f0 goda gehwylc. \u00de\u00e6r g\u00e6sta gedryht h\u00e6lend herga\u00f0 ond heofoncyninges meahte m\u00e6rsia\u00f0, singa\u00f0 metude lof. Swinsa\u00f0 sibgedryht swega m\u00e6ste h\u00e6dre ymb \u00fe\u00e6t halge heahseld godes, bli\u00fee bletsia\u00f0 bregu selestan Micel, unm\u00e6te m\u00e6gnes streng\u00f0u, heah ond halig. Heofonas sind",
